  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Campaign to Raise Awareness on the Rights and Obligations of Migrant Workers and Employers of Migrant Domestic Workers in Bahrain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The campaign aims to ensure that all migrant workers are fully aware of their rights, responsibilities and services available to them and that employers of migrant domestic workers are aware of their obligations and rights, as well as provided with practical guidance on managing employer-employee relationships. The campaign will also have a focus on supporting potential victims of trafficking. To this end the overall objective of the proposed project is to contribute to reducing vulnerabilities of victims of trafficking in persons in employer-employee relationships in Bahrain by increasing their awareness and accessibility of information on rights and responsibilities of migrant workers and their employers.</narrative>
  </description>
